{"id":"09-vadret","level":"A1","title":{"sv":"Vilket väder!","en":"What weather!","zh":"这天气！"},"scene":{"en":"Sara and Li complain about the rain and plan a Sunday hike.","zh":"Sara 和 Li 抱怨下雨，计划周日去远足。"},"vocab":[{"sv":"frysa","en":"to be cold, to freeze","zh":"觉得冷"},{"sv":"följa med","en":"to come along","zh":"一起去"},{"sv":"matsäck","en":"packed lunch","zh":"自带的野餐食物"},{"sv":"hur dags","en":"at what time","zh":"几点"}],"lines":[{"who":"Sara","sv":"Vilket väder! Det regnar hela tiden.","en":"What weather! It rains all the time.","zh":"这什么天气！一直下雨。","tokens":[{"t":"Vilket","id":161},{"t":" "},{"t":"väder","id":1724},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"regnar","id":3723},{"t":" "},{"t":"hela","id":189},{"t":" "},{"t":"tiden","id":183},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"Weather sentences always start with “det”: det regnar, det snöar, det blåser.","zh":"天气句总是以“det”开头：det regnar（下雨）、det snöar（下雪）、det blåser（刮风）。"},"audio":"audio/09-vadret/01.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja, och det är kallt. Jag fryser.","en":"Yes, and it's cold. I'm freezing.","zh":"是啊，而且很冷。我冻死了。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":", "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"är","id":88},{"t":" "},{"t":"kallt","id":1253},{"t":". "},{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"fryser","id":3858},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/02.mp3"},{"who":"Sara","sv":"Imorgon ska det bli sol, säger de.","en":"Tomorrow it's supposed to be sunny, they say.","zh":"他们说明天会出太阳。","tokens":[{"t":"Imorgon","id":991},{"t":" "},{"t":"ska","id":101},{"t":" "},{"t":"det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"bli","id":122},{"t":" "},{"t":"sol","id":1073},{"t":", "},{"t":"säger","id":145},{"t":" "},{"t":"de","id":107},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Ska det bli” – is going to be (a forecast).","zh":"“ska det bli” = 将会是（预报）。"},"audio":"audio/09-vadret/03.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Skönt! Då kan vi gå ut.","en":"Lovely! Then we can go out.","zh":"太好了！那我们可以出门了。","tokens":[{"t":"Skönt","id":1093},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Då","id":154},{"t":" "},{"t":"kan","id":100},{"t":" "},{"t":"vi","id":112},{"t":" "},{"t":"gå","id":144},{"t":" "},{"t":"ut","id":162},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Skönt!” = nice, what a relief.","zh":"“Skönt!” = 真好、舒服、松了口气。"},"audio":"audio/09-vadret/04.mp3"},{"who":"Sara","sv":"Vill du följa med och vandra på söndag?","en":"Do you want to come along hiking on Sunday?","zh":"周日想一起去远足吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"följa med","v":"följa med"},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"vandra","id":2312},{"t":" "},{"t":"på","id":95},{"t":" "},{"t":"söndag","id":929},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/05.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja, det låter kul. Vad ska jag ta med?","en":"Yes, that sounds fun. What should I bring?","zh":"好啊，听起来很有意思。我要带什么？","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":", "},{"t":"det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"låter","id":212},{"t":" "},{"t":"kul","id":815},{"t":". "},{"t":"Vad","id":147},{"t":" "},{"t":"ska","id":101},{"t":" "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"ta","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"med","id":104},{"t":"?"}],"note":{"en":"“Det låter kul” – that sounds fun. “Ta med” = bring along.","zh":"“Det låter kul” = 听起来很有趣。“ta med” = 带上。"},"audio":"audio/09-vadret/06.mp3"},{"who":"Sara","sv":"Varma kläder, bra skor och matsäck.","en":"Warm clothes, good shoes and a packed lunch.","zh":"保暖的衣服、好走的鞋和吃的。","tokens":[{"t":"Varma","id":1199},{"t":" "},{"t":"kläder","id":1331},{"t":", "},{"t":"bra","id":166},{"t":" "},{"t":"skor","id":2233},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"matsäck","v":"matsäck"},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/07.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Hur lång tid tar turen?","en":"How long does the hike take?","zh":"远足要多久？","tokens":[{"t":"Hur","id":157},{"t":" "},{"t":"lång","id":338},{"t":" "},{"t":"tid","id":183},{"t":" "},{"t":"tar","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"turen","id":488},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/08.mp3"},{"who":"Sara","sv":"Ungefär fyra timmar. Vi går tidigt.","en":"About four hours. We'll leave early.","zh":"大约四小时。我们早点出发。","tokens":[{"t":"Ungefär","id":670},{"t":" "},{"t":"fyra","id":16},{"t":" "},{"t":"timmar","id":525},{"t":". "},{"t":"Vi","id":112},{"t":" "},{"t":"går","id":144},{"t":" "},{"t":"tidigt","id":475},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/09.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Okej, hur dags?","en":"OK, what time?","zh":"好，几点？","tokens":[{"t":"Okej","id":3068},{"t":", "},{"t":"hur dags","v":"hur dags"},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/10.mp3"},{"who":"Sara","sv":"Klockan nio vid stationen.","en":"Nine o'clock at the station.","zh":"九点，在车站。","tokens":[{"t":"Klockan","id":795},{"t":" "},{"t":"nio","id":40},{"t":" "},{"t":"vid","id":164},{"t":" "},{"t":"stationen","id":2929},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/09-vadret/11.mp3"}],"series":"Basics"}